    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830710/extras/ca532aa50280c7f29555966aa0b5d5b2.avif?t=1750925202\" width=616 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and activate the hidden effects of an ever-changing pyramid in this minesweeper-like game of mystery boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 unique box types of varying rarity to unlock, each round could be over in a single click, or it could take a whole lot of opening, closing, using, revealing, transforming, and destroying boxes to win it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix it up with different board types, overhauling the rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet characters ready to offer you special boxes to help maximise your win streaks, ensuring no two rounds of Vexbox are the same!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830710/extras/ca532aa50280c7f29555966aa0b5d5b2.avif?t=1750925202\" width=616 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and activate the hidden effects of an ever-changing pyramid in this minesweeper-like game of mystery boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 unique box types of varying rarity to unlock, each round could be over in a single click, or it could take a whole lot of opening, closing, using, revealing, transforming, and destroying boxes to win it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix it up with different board types, overhauling the rules of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet characters ready to offer you special boxes to help maximise your win streaks, ensuring no two rounds of Vexbox are the same!</p>",
